# Verification

After code changes, follow **`verify-feature`** in the correct mode.

Development mode, before each phase commit:

1. `rtk dotnet build src/Ticket/Ticket.slnx`
2. Focused unit/business tests plus affected regressions
3. Contract and Backend DoD review
4. Commit only a clean, phase-scoped staged diff
5. Mark `Development Complete`, not API Verified

Postman mode, only after the separate database approval:

1. Use the real API and approved test database; mocks do not count as Passed
2. Execute every documented scenario for the current phase
3. Keep fixing and re-running until all required scenarios pass
4. Write Scenario Coverage and FE handoff evidence
5. Mark `API Verified` only when the phase is fully green
6. Report the migration command if schema changed; do not generate migrations unless asked

Do not mark the project complete until every phase is both Development Complete and API Verified.
